          }
        },
        "block_2_wipdLf": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist gluten-free?",
            "content": "<p>Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist is formulated without gluten. It’s important to note that while all Summer Fridays products are formulated to be gluten-free, we cannot guarantee that they have been produced in a gluten-free facility. However, The National Celiac Association has stated that unless cosmetic products are ingested, there should not be an issue with gluten in topical products. <br/><br/>Please see <a href=\"https://nationalceliac.org/celiac-disease-questions/using-gluten-free-skin-body-products-someone-celiac-disease/\">here</a> for additional information. As always, if there is concern, we recommend that you consult with your physician/healthcare provider prior to use.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_PFnEJE": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist non-comedogenic?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist is non-comedogenic, which means it will not clog pores.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_acezwF": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist suitable for all skin types?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_xY79XQ": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist fragrance-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist is formulated without fragrance.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_QfifeU": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist with AHAs or BHAs?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist can be used with AHAs and BHAs.<br/><br/>We recommend applying AHAs and BHAs prior to applying Jet Lag  Skin Soothing Hydration Mist.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_a3MNp4": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist with retinol?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist can be used with retinol and retinol derivatives.<br/>We recommend applying Jet Lag Skin Soothing Hydration Mist prior to applying retinol.</p>",
